      <h2 id="manual-configuration-of-cli-profiles-example_managing-cli-profiles" class="group scroll-mt-20">Manually configuring CLI profiles<a href="#manual-configuration-of-cli-profiles-example_managing-cli-profiles" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
